Third-party material redistributed with the Kubernetes operator (operator/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The operator embeds the following upstream artifacts verbatim so that a
self-hosted platform installs without reaching any chart repository at runtime.
Each is redistributed under its own license, reproduced within the artifact
where the upstream ships one; the versions are pinned in operator/Makefile.

  OpenFGA Helm chart          https://github.com/openfga/helm-charts          Apache-2.0
  Temporal Helm chart         https://github.com/temporalio/helm-charts       MIT
  Bitnami Valkey Helm chart   https://github.com/bitnami/charts               Apache-2.0
  OpenBao Helm chart          https://github.com/openbao/openbao-helm         MPL-2.0
  Neo4j Helm chart            https://github.com/neo4j/helm-charts            Apache-2.0
  CloudNativePG release       https://github.com/cloudnative-pg/cloudnative-pg Apache-2.0
  Tekton Pipelines release    https://github.com/tektoncd/pipeline            Apache-2.0

The operator's identity-server login theme embeds the Inter typeface
(https://github.com/rsms/inter), licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
